  "title": "Pure virtual functions",
  "summary": "Go-to-definition on the declaration of a pure virtual function lists its overrides",
  "prose": "Nothing defines a pure virtual function: standing on its declaration,\ngo-to-definition reaches the overrides that do. A call through it reaches\nthe declaration, as for any function nothing defines.",
